</custom_item>

<custom_item>
  type              : AUDIT_POWERSHELL
  description       : "1.0064 - MSWRK - Ensure Configure use of hardware-based encryption for removable data drives is set to Disabled"
  info              : "This policy setting allows you to manage BitLocker's use of hardware-based encryption on removable data drives and specify which encryption algorithms it can use with hardware-based encryption."
