  description       : "1.0084 - MSWRK - Ensure Allow Diagnostic Data is set to Enabled: Diagnostic data off (not recommended) or Enabled: Send required diagnostic data"
  info              : "This policy setting determines the amount of diagnostic and usage data reported to Microsoft: - A value of (0) Diagnostic data off (not recommended)."
