</custom_item>

<custom_item>
  type              : AUDIT_POWERSHELL
  description       : "1.0219 - MSWRK - Ensure MSS: (NoNameReleaseOnDemand) Allow the computer to ignore NetBIOS name release requests except from WINS servers is set to Enabled"
