<custom_item>
  type              : AUDIT_POWERSHELL
  description       : "1.0226 - MSWRK - Ensure Minimize the number of simultaneous connections to the Internet or a Windows Domain is set to Enabled: 3 = Prevent Wi-Fi when on Ethernet"
  info              : "This policy setting prevents computers from establishing multiple simultaneous connections to either the Internet or to a Windows domain."
  reference         : "NIST 800-53r5|CM-1 CM-2 CM-6 CM-7 CM-7(1) CM-9 SA-3 SA-8 SA-10"
