</custom_item>

<custom_item>
  type              : AUDIT_POWERSHELL
  description       : "1.0414 - MSWRK - Ensure Microsoft FTP Service (FTPSVC) is set to Disabled or Not Installed"
  info              : "Enables the server to be a File Transfer Protocol (FTP) server."
